{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/703896ce87e9acb514c669067278cddc.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategy-meets-relaxation farming sim where tulips become your paint and the field your canvas. Plan and plant each bloom in harmony to form graceful patterns across your field. Whether you tend it daily or let it flourish in idle mode, your goal is simple: create beauty worthy of a king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/e9acf69c7074fd3e37abaf7b021309e7.poster.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/e9acf69c7074fd3e37abaf7b021309e7.webm?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/e9acf69c7074fd3e37abaf7b021309e7.mp4?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0Relaxing gameplay with optional idle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37 One evolving field to grow, arrange, and improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a012 tulip types with unique colors and patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0Light management: balance beauty, timing, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37 A calm world inspired by Dutch countryside and folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/22db85477ea95e1ebf0fc4e2deee8aed.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant bulbs, water them, and help them flourish into colorful tulips. Expand your field over time, upgrade your tools, and make small improvements that help your garden thrive. Find calm in shaping your layout and watching it fill with life at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/5263507dd7f1c1506fcfb4ef051fe1b2.poster.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/5263507dd7f1c1506fcfb4ef051fe1b2.webm?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/5263507dd7f1c1506fcfb4ef051fe1b2.mp4?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/a945c0e83f10c47abd82e6abf9268807.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new tulip types as your farm develops. Breed flowers to reveal fresh color mixes and rare double blooms that add depth and beauty to your designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/57d39a6754826c6e110e4c2ca17bbd6a.poster.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/57d39a6754826c6e110e4c2ca17bbd6a.webm?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/57d39a6754826c6e110e4c2ca17bbd6a.mp4?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/95b71292de325f65aa3e23fca448cdf2.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check in to plan your next pattern, or step away and let your tulips grow on their own. Your field keeps evolving even while you\u2019re not playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/cc65495c6c523d41c40586e457286f7c.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with visitors who stop by your farm and learn their stories. Completing small favors for them can bring rewards, new opportunities, and a few friendly smiles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/fc53c088a3fa3e3aa6f269297d1690df.poster.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/fc53c088a3fa3e3aa6f269297d1690df.webm?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/fc53c088a3fa3e3aa6f269297d1690df.mp4?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/d377ebaf06b7d758e70e54ba57ae2925.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your field grows more beautiful, it starts to draw attention. Create harmony and color across your land, and perhaps even earn the admiration of the king himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/41162b0631a5425077846195016e6d7a.poster.avif?t=1767717765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/41162b0631a5425077846195016e6d7a.webm?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/41162b0631a5425077846195016e6d7a.mp4?t=1767717765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1767717765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1767717765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/f5c9b842e724c275231ad01f75af625bc714d686/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767717765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/f5c9b842e724c275231ad01f75af625bc714d686/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767717765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors"